            description: "Small, globose, reddish purple, red fleshed clingstone ripening in early July. The flesh is soft, juicy and of fair to good flavor. The tree is upright spreading, vigorous, and productive with low susceptibility to bacterial spot. The tree is an Asian X American hybrid that is self-fruitful"
